      "rationale": "Crew U-A/U-B collected work folder and lock equipment at 09:35 (supported by n-3thrsy). A command, field-position observation, and proved internal valve condition are different records per IA-D02. The crew's possession of the work folder constitutes a 'command' or 'field-position observation', not proof that an internal valve was physically in a specific state.",
      "status": "supported",
      "sourceIds": ["24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1","d838e866-dc34-4814-8dad-3b97d0353f05#1"],
      "claimIds": ["finding-1cln0o1", "claim-7262ne"],"counterfactual":"If the crew had not collected the work folder, would they have been able to observe valve positions or prove internal conditions? No; possession of a document does not equate to physical observation.",
      "competingExplanation": "The command/observation and proved condition are distinct records. The absence of one (e.g., no field observation) does not imply the other did not occur, but they cannot be conflated as identical evidence.","evidenceGap":"Need explicit record showing whether a valve position was physically observed or commanded at any time during boundary preparation to distinguish between 'command' and 'proved condition'."}
    ],
    "decision": {
      "summary": "The investigation identifies that the crew collected work documentation (n-3thrsy) but no evidence confirms they performed physical observations of valve states. The distinction between a command/observation record and a proved internal valve condition is critical per IA-D02 conventions.",
      "evidenceUsed": ["IA-S01_shift_and_notification_log.md", "d838e866-dc34-4814-8dad-3b97d0353f05#1"],
      "unknowns": [
        "Whether a valve position was physically observed or commanded during boundary preparation.",
        "The specific cause of the air-low indication at P-R (n-8pkzru)."
      ],
      "alternatives": [
        "A service-routing change occurred without proper documentation, but this remains unsupported by current evidence."
      ],"confidence":0.75},"evidenceRequests":[
    "requestId" ]}
